	(text "SPI at 8 MHz, mode 0; CS0-CS11 shifted by each module (barrel shift); LATCH on SYNC0; OE active low.\nSeries 49.9 ohm at the source on everything the base drives; pull-ups keep CS, LATCH and OE inactive\nwhile the MCU pins are not configured. MISO is terminated on the module side."
